### Health Check
GET http://localhost:8000/health

###

### Upload PDF from storage/documents
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/ingestion/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="source"

local-test
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="finance_test.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./storage/documents/finance_test.pdf
--boundary--

###

### Search chunks only (no generation)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/retrieval/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "What was Apple total net sales in 2024?",
  "top_n": 3
}

###

### Generate — net sales
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/generation/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "What was Apple total net sales in 2024?"
}

###

### Generate — services revenue
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/generation/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "What was Apple services revenue in 2024?"
}

###

### Generate — China revenue
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/generation/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "How much revenue did Apple generate in Greater China?"
}

###

### Generate — net income
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/generation/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "What was Apple net income in fiscal year 2024?"
}

